   <dc:description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">NEW YORK - JULY 1: People enjoying relaxing outdoors in Central Park on July 1, 2012 in New York. The park is the most visited urban park in the United States with 35 million visitors annually.</rdf:li>
